{"4014460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Horror Scenarios: The Redwood Estate", "steam_appid": 4014460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Demo Version 1.7 is now live</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo Version 1.7</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for all the amazing feedback you've shared since the demo launched! This update focuses on improving the overall experience by introducing new quality-of-life features and implementing many of your suggestions. We're committed to making the game the best it can be, and your feedback is helping shape its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated title screen for a more dynamic main menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New dynamic overhead text sequences to enhance storytelling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved death screen with the option to Load Game or Return to Main Menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completely reworked Options Menu, providing a better foundation for future settings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Added a new Twin Stick control scheme for gamepad players.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Improvements</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved and balanced various sound effects throughout the demo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reworked the intro sequence timing to better showcase the guard's death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changed the spore damage effect back to red for clearer player feedback.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coming Next</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load Game directly from the in-game pause menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An additional modern control scheme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Film Noir visual filter for an entirely different horror experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you to everyone who has played the demo, reported bugs, and shared feedback. Every update brings us one step closer to the experience we want to deliver. Please keep letting us know what you think—we're listening, and we're building this game together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you in the next update!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officers Tim Rieff and Kim Hansbury are dispatched to the remote Redwood Estate after contact is lost with two fellow officers. What begins as a routine welfare check quickly turns into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the estate, silence hides the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/96030fe20c790e0701f03a2d1612ee6f.poster.avif?t=1786120574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/96030fe20c790e0701f03a2d1612ee6f.webm?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/96030fe20c790e0701f03a2d1612ee6f.mp4?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To locate their missing colleagues and uncover what happened to the residents and staff, Tim and Kim must explore the manor and its surroundings, search for survivors, and face the growing threat hidden within its walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/57cc8ea404a99d309ba9677582758960.poster.avif?t=1786120574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/57cc8ea404a99d309ba9677582758960.webm?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/57cc8ea404a99d309ba9677582758960.mp4?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, investigate, and survive in a tense, top-down horror experience inspired by classic survival horror games. With limited controls and scarce resources, every decision can be the difference between life and death</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect your arsenal to defend yourself against horrific enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/8e109da50906e7ccb26d2b00964dfd72.poster.avif?t=1786120574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/8e109da50906e7ccb26d2b00964dfd72.webm?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/8e109da50906e7ccb26d2b00964dfd72.mp4?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the manor and its surroundings in search of your missing fellow officers. Uncover the mysterious events that led to the tragic fate of the residents and staff of the Redwood Estate in this atmospheric survival horror experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/b9a0ebafaf4a1c658a1da971e61bc8c1.poster.avif?t=1786120574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/b9a0ebafaf4a1c658a1da971e61bc8c1.webm?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/b9a0ebafaf4a1c658a1da971e61bc8c1.mp4?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every corner for the tools you’ll need to survive against terrifying enemies while carefully managing your limited resources.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/7bd09012c9086487b81f0bd72703d942.poster.avif?t=1786120574\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/7bd09012c9086487b81f0bd72703d942.webm?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014460/extras/7bd09012c9086487b81f0bd72703d942.mp4?t=1786120574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack composed in-house supports the atmosphere with moments of dread, restraint, and brief relief between encounters.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2000.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officers Tim Rieff and Kim Hansbury are dispatched to the remote Redwood Estate after contact is lost with two fellow officers. What begins as a routine welfare check quickly turns into something far more disturbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the estate, silence hides the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://